{"mls":"B1722924","addr":"11775 Lapp Road","muni":"Hume town","town":"Hume","county":"Allegany","zip":"14735","ll":[42.510402,-78.141015],"status":"Active","type":"Single Family","units":1,"beds":2,"baths":1,"sqft":2296.0,"year":2025,"lot":6.1,"dom":0,"price":324900,"orig":null,"chg":"New Listing","tax":361,"tax_mls":true,"hoa":null,"office":"NextHome Prosper","phone":"716-473-1159","hhp":false,"remarks":"Welcome to 11775 Lapp Road in Fillmore. Set on 6.1 acres, this home offers nearly 2,500 square feet of living space with plenty of potential. Included on the property is a barn and a newly constructed detached two-car garage.  \r\n\r\nThe open layout of the house brings the kitchen, dining area, and family room together in one large space, with rich custom elm wood cabinetry, a wood cookstove on a stone hearth, and wood-look flooring. A spacious living room offers even more room to gather. The home has two bedrooms, a full bath, a walk-in pantry, a utility room,  and several additional main-level rooms that can be shaped around how to make the property your own. The open basement is ready for storage, a workshop, or future finished space.\r\n\r\nThe entrance to the house features two covered entrances and a concrete patio perfect for a fire pit or just taking in the scenery. The covered porch on the side of the house is also a perfect spot to take in the surrounding rural setting. The barn has six horse stalls, a one-car garage bay, a covered lean-to, and a hayloft on the upper level. The detached garage includes a concrete floor and plenty of storage for vehicles, equipment, or a shop. Additional features include a metal roof, vinyl siding, private well, and private septic system. \r\n\r\nLocated in the Fillmore School District, this home is just a short drive from the towns of Fillmore and Houghton, about 15 minutes from Letchworth State Park, and within a 75-minute drive of both Buffalo and Rochester. Bring your ideas and make this property yours today!","facts"